# anynet topology -- one router per physical chiplet, star-connected
# through a shared hub router. router <id> node <chiplet id attached>
# link router <a> router <b>  -- bidirectional link between two routers.
# CHECK exact keyword syntax against your BookSim version before use.
router 0 node 0
router 1 node 1
router 2 node 2
router 3 node 3
router 4 node 4
router 5 node
link router 0 router 5
link router 1 router 5
link router 2 router 5
link router 3 router 5
link router 4 router 5
